DELETE /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/page_shield/policies/{policy_id}
Permanently deletes a content security rule by ID.
Required: zone_id (path); policy_id (path)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/page_shield/connections/{connection_id}
Returns a webpage connection detected on the zone by connection ID.
Required: zone_id (path); connection_id (path)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/page_shield/cookies/{cookie_id}
Returns a cookie detected on the zone by cookie ID.
Required: zone_id (path); cookie_id (path)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/page_shield/policies/{policy_id}
Returns a content security rule by ID.
Required: zone_id (path); policy_id (path)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/page_shield/scripts/{script_id}
Returns a script detected on the zone by script ID.
Required: zone_id (path); script_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/page_shield/policies/{policy_id}
Updates the description, action, expression, enabled state, and policy value for a content security rule.
Required: zone_id (path); policy_id (path); body (body)
